flowchart LR
  W[Worker instance] --> C[Short SQL claim transaction]
  C --> L[Lease owner / until / rowversion]
  L --> S[Send outside transaction]
  S -->|broker ack| U[Conditional delivered update]
  S -->|crash / no persisted ack| X[Lease expires]
  X --> R[Another Worker reclaims same EventId]
  R --> I[Inbox idempotency - E4]
  B[Backlog observation] --> E{age + count + rate + DLQ + capacity}
  E -->|warning| D[Degraded + alert]
  E -->|critical| P[Worker NotReady + scoped backpressure]
  P --> SAFE[Reads and unrelated production stay open]
